<title>HONG KONG: Trade in China Everbright-IHD suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in China Everbright-IHD suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property concern China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$1.75 or 17.24 percent to HK$11.90 on Friday.</p>
<p>A China Everbright-IHD spokesman said the company was preparing an announcement which would be available later on Monday. He gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
